{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "LEV",
  "chapter": 9,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "LEV.9.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.9.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass on the eighth day, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Moses called Aaron and his sons, and the elders of Israel;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.9.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.9.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he said to Aaron, Take thee a young calf for a sin-offering, and a ram for a burnt-offering, without blemish, and offer ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " before the LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.9.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.9.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And to the children of Israel thou shalt speak, saying, Take ye a kid of the goats for a sin-offering; and a calf and a lamb, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "both",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of the first year, without blemish, for a burnt-offering;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.9.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.9.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Also a bullock and a ram for peace-offerings, to sacrifice before the LORD; and a meat-offering mingled with oil: for to-day the LORD will appear to you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.9.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.9.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they brought ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " which Moses commanded before the tabernacle of the congregation: and all the congregation drew near and stood before the LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.9.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.9.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Moses said, This ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the thing which the LORD commanded that ye should do: and the glory of the LORD shall appear to you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.9.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.9.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Moses said to Aaron, Go to the altar, and offer thy sin-offering, and thy burnt-offering, and make an atonement for thyself, and for the people: and offer the offering of the people, and make an atonement for them; as the LORD commanded.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.9.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.9.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Aaron therefore went to the altar, and slew the calf of the sin-offering, which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " for himself.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.9.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.9.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Aaron brought the blood to him: and he dipped his finger in the blood, and put ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upon the horns of the altar, and poured out the blood at the bottom of the altar:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.9.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.9.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But the fat, and the kidneys, and the caul above the liver of the sin-offering, he burnt upon the altar; as the LORD commanded Moses.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.9.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.9.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the flesh and the hide he burnt with fire without the camp.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.9.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.9.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he slew the burnt-offering; and Aaron's sons presented to him the blood, which he sprinkled around upon the altar.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.9.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.9.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they presented the burnt-offering to him, with the pieces of it, and the head: and he burnt ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upon the altar.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.9.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.9.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he washed the inwards and the legs, and burnt ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upon the burnt-offering on the altar.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.9.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.9.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he brought the people's offering, and took the goat, which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the sin-offering for the people, and slew it, and offered it for sin, as the first.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.9.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.9.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he brought the burnt-offering, and offered it according to the manner.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.9.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.9.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he brought the meat-offering, and took a handful of it, and burnt ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upon the altar, beside the burnt-sacrifice of the morning.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.9.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.9.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He slew also the bullock and the ram ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "for",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a sacrifice of peace-offerings, which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " for the people: and Aaron's sons presented to him the blood, which he sprinkled around upon the altar,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.9.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.9.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the fat of the bullock, and of the ram, the rump, and that which covereth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the inwards",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and the kidneys, and the caul ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "above",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the liver:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.9.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.9.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they put the fat upon the breasts, and he burnt the fat upon the altar:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.9.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.9.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the breasts and the right shoulder Aaron waved ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "for",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a wave-offering before the LORD; as Moses commanded.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.9.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.9.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Aaron lifted up his hand towards the people, and blessed them; and came down from offering the sin-offering, and the burnt-offering, and peace-offerings.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.9.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.9.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Moses and Aaron went into the tabernacle of the congregation, and came out, and blessed the people: and the glory of the LORD appeared to all the people.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.9.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.9.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And there came out a fire from before the LORD, and consumed upon the altar the burnt-offering and the fat: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "which",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", when all the people saw, they shouted, and fell on their faces.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
